WEBVTT

00:00:58.663 --> 00:01:00.762
So as you think about
making a career change,

00:01:00.786 --> 00:01:02.601
here are a few tips
I hope you consider

00:01:02.625 --> 00:01:04.778
and a few things
I've picked up along the way.

00:01:04.802 --> 00:01:08.283
First, there's three things to think about
before you're ready to move on.

00:01:08.307 --> 00:01:10.598
Number one: professional
life is about learning.

00:01:10.622 --> 00:01:12.956
If you're not even interested
in learning anymore,

00:01:12.980 --> 00:01:14.131
that's a huge red flag

00:01:14.155 --> 00:01:16.884
that there might not be
a future for you in that industry.

00:01:16.908 --> 00:01:19.159
Number two: career changes
are often gut-driven.

00:01:19.183 --> 00:01:21.052
If you constantly have sleepless nights

00:01:21.076 --> 00:01:23.702
where you're wide awake staring
at the ceiling thinking,

00:01:23.726 --> 00:01:26.976
"Oh, man. I can't live with myself
if I never try to make this change

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:29.060
or if I don't even
actually investigate it,"

00:01:29.084 --> 00:01:30.235
then trust your gut.